n-digital text layer, so neither is a misread, and which one the town intended is not established. And one typographical defect: Total Facilities & Buildings is printed `$ 590.754.00`, with a FULL STOP where the thousands comma belongs. The section's own lines sum to 590,754.00, so the value is not in doubt and the separator is simply wrong."},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 17 Annual Town Audit","fund_name":"Annual Town Audit","column":"voted","value":"43000.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 18 Charter Review Committee","fund_name":"Charter Review Committee","column":"voted","value":"0.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 19 Selectmen's Administration","fund_name":"Selectmen's Administration","column":"voted","value":"63123.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 20 Selectmen Salaries","fund_name":"Selectmen Salaries","column":"voted","value":"500.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 21 Town Manager Salary","fund_name":"Town Manager Salary","column":"voted","value":"125000.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 22 Town Manager Expense","fund_name":"Town Manager Expense","column":"voted","value":"5250.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139","document":"","fund_number":"General Government :: 23 Town Accountant","fund_name":"Town Accountant","column":"voted","value":"146768.0","status":"checked","reconciliation":"","read_by":"","proof":""},{"fy":2014,"page":"139"